Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I guess since I'm gonna live here,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I need to start looking for a good
