EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} extended an invitation,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
so I'm gonna be moving here in the
very near future.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
We'll be neighbors! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} mi ha invitato
a restare qui,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} quindi tra
non molto mi trasferirò.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
E saremo vicini di casa! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Paura, eh?!

{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ehi!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Adesso sto campeggiando, ma
